cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PReSto Holocene DA Template"
abstract: >-
  A template repository used by PReSto (Paleoclimate Reconstruction
  Storehouse) to reproduce and customize the Holocene temperature
  reconstruction of Erb et al. (2022) via GitHub Actions. The workflow
  acquires proxy observations from LiPDverse, constructs a model prior from
  transient climate simulations (HadCM3 and TraCE-21ka), and runs offline
  paleoclimate data assimilation inside containerized environments to
  reconstruct spatially complete temperature fields over the past 12,000 years.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: David
    family-names: Edge
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6938-2850"
  - given-names: Nicholas
    family-names: McKay
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3598-5113"
